# LUNARA — ADDITIONAL FEATURE EXPANSION
## Admin Intelligence, User Communication, Affirmations & Bhagavad Gita Wisdom

These are additional features to implement within the existing Lunara application.

Integrate them into the current architecture, design system, navigation, dashboard and existing functionality. Do not build them as disconnected standalone pages.

The overall goal is to make Lunara more meaningful, engaging, useful and personal while keeping the interface attractive, structured, colorful, and uncluttered.

---

# 1. EXPANDED ADMIN SYSTEM — MASTER ADMIN CAPABILITIES

The Admin system should be significantly more capable than a basic dashboard.

The Admin is responsible for overseeing the platform, managing users, understanding application activity, maintaining content, communicating with users and exporting data when necessary.

Create a structured, professional Admin experience with a proper management hierarchy.

## 1.1 Admin overview

Create a comprehensive Admin dashboard that includes:

- Total registered users
- Active accounts
- Inactive accounts
- New registrations
- Recent activity
- Check-in activity overview
- Journal activity overview
- User engagement summaries
- Pending administrative tasks
- Notifications/communication status
- Content management overview
- System status

Present information visually using:

- Charts
- Graphs
- Tables
- Timeline
- Activity summaries
- Status indicators
- Structured data panels

Do not make the dashboard cluttered.

Use a clear visual hierarchy, placing important information first and detailed information in dedicated sections.

Use real data when available. Use clearly labeled mock data only for the current frontend prototype.

