## Calendar

If useful, display a small wisdom indicator for a selected day or allow users to revisit saved wisdom.

Do not overcrowd the calendar.

## Insights

Wisdom may appear as a small reflection alongside the insights, but must never make spiritual interpretations of the user's wellbeing data.

